yarn-error.log*

# The measurement scripts ARE committed — every `> Verified:` line on a page names
# one, and a reviewer must be able to re-run it. Only dependencies and run
# artifacts are ignored; lockfiles are kept so a re-run pins the same versions.
sandbox/**/node_modules/
sandbox/**/.stryker-tmp/
sandbox/**/*.log
build-react*
build-*
.docusaurus-*

# Generated search indexes copied into static/ so that `yarn start` has working
# search (the plugin only indexes during a build). They are build output, not
# source: regenerate with `yarn search:index`. Never commit them — the
# whole-site index measured 94.7 MB, and `yarn deploy` pushes the built site to
# gh-pages where GitHub hard-blocks any file over 100 MB.
static/search-index*.json